{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-33","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：比例与整数","englishTitle":"Given as many numbers as we please, to find the least of those which have the same ratio with them.","book":7,"number":33,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.33","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.33/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":33,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","contentId":"euclid-7-33","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2cc356a98027fcd3677ffec01775afc5f33e3c777cf576872a9be19b76c993d8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-33.statement","euclid-7-33.construction.1","euclid-7-33.proof.1","euclid-7-33.proof.2","euclid-7-33.proof.3","euclid-7-33.proof.4","euclid-7-33.proof.5","euclid-7-33.proof.6","euclid-7-33.proof.7","euclid-7-33.construction.2","euclid-7-33.proof.8","euclid-7-33.proof.9","euclid-7-33.proof.10","euclid-7-33.proof.11","euclid-7-33.proof.12","euclid-7-33.proof.13","euclid-7-33.proof.14","euclid-7-33.proof.15","euclid-7-33.proof.16","euclid-7-33.proof.17","euclid-7-33.proof.18","euclid-7-33.conclusion","euclid-7-33.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-33.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5faad255293edb4079f4a4bbdfb0f1adf116d551c62d921648aade4f630cb5f3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Given as many numbers as we please, to find the least of those which have the same ratio with them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以我们所希望的人数来看, 找到最少的 与它们相同比例的人。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"42a2f65854902f1ca9653c77f5876f06d981b7858d6b06a8e2c113f14659143b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C be the given numbers, as many as we please; thus it is required to find the least of those which have the same ratio with A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B,C成为指定数字,我们想多少就多少;因此,需要找到与A,B,C相同比例的最小数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4dbec9fe08e68592170afbf7b2eac7038d6c52021e1cd3866328d68a24fc3eb9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"A, B, C are either prime to one another or not."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B,C 要么互素,要么不是。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"380e6618e6dd020f6a0d9dcbd0877e30cd2ebbe183935b213734f131be3fa692","citations":["euclid-7-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, if A, B, C are prime to one another, they are the least of those which have the same ratio with them. [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,如果A,B,C是互素, 它们是最不 与它们具有相同比例的人。 [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52e0b5dbf0aae9373d7396b6c9e485922bdfff7f8d7b438669d952e71e353efa","citations":["euclid-7-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if not, let D the greatest common measure of A, B, C be taken, [[VII. 3](/principles/euclid-7-3)] and, as many times as D measures the numbers A, B, C respectively, so many units let there be in the numbers E, F, G respectively."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果不是,则D最大公约数个,即A,B,C,分别是A,B,C,单位个,分别是D,个。（相关点与线段：G） [[VII. 3](/principles/euclid-7-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a27455cbeed206b2964813e926598fc4512e68e960c05e3116cf49e6336b1f2d","citations":["euclid-7-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the numbers E, F, G measure the numbers A, B, C respectively according to the units in D. [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,根据D的单位数字,数字分别为E、F、G、整除、A、B、C。 [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e5380cfb84aa9adbb4eddeb09dd84f874685466fd72a8e218e81f1d5f894fa8","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore E, F, G measure A, B, C the same number of times; therefore E, F, G are in the same ratio with A, B, C. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E、F、G、整除、A、B、C次相同;因此,E、F、G和A的比相同,分别为A、B、C。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"047b9fd618e125584bb22c71d29887ea16d0c22c9e5223c6f77c018cb47b642f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that they are the least that are in that ratio."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我要说,它们是最不那么符合这一比的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d666429d23bd64ac9575e9df2c5681a6ca00712938f99ac3261caa9ecf81dbd5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if E, F, G are not the least of those which have the same ratio with A, B, C, there will be numbers less than E, F, G which are in the same ratio with A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果E,F,G不是A,B,C中与E,B,C相同的比例,那么人数将少于E,F,G,与A,B,C的比例相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":9,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0b07e65e375e11a968f4e1f1b31fea342a054a3762eaa754bd5d57c908d741c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them be H, K, L; therefore H measures A the same number of times that the numbers K, L measure the numbers B, C respectively."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"数字是H,K,L;因此,H,整除,A,与数字分别为K,L,整除的B,C的相同次数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"921e8c22f44a0136dd28f6963ef2668bbc10025ee0d229ffe7e02a4965d6f384","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, as many times as H measures A, so many units let there be in M; therefore the numbers K, L also measure the numbers B, C respectively according to the units in M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,H 整除 A, 这么多的单位 允许在M 中出现, 因此,根据M的单位, K, L 和 整除 , 分别为B, C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"465b95f697c47a132edd1be4fb0809b987d8a017c7df54edf5d869f45ca75376","citations":["euclid-7-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since H measures A according to the units in M, therefore M also measures A according to the units in H. [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有根据M的单位,自H 整除 A起因此,根据H的单位数据,M也是整除 A。 [[VII. 16](/principles/euclid-7-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f675096aef59f5c0c592c9e125cd022451314c5d06f93f221b2f23fea6f23b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason M also measures the numbers B, C according to the units in the numbers K, L respectively;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,M也是整除,根据单位的数字,分别为K、L,人数为B;（相关点与线段：C）"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10abe63fe18ed34fb0b7a34e6c168f21a72a99a0c0da80e25acc92ffd9c5262e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore M measures A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,M 整除 A,B,C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a1f175b3aaef5e4b959acac5866268aa9113c40c5ef50a4fe29ff64dbcd394c","citations":["euclid-7-def-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since H measures A according to the units in M, therefore H by multiplying M has made A. [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,从H 整除 A M 中单位,H乘以M 已经A。 [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4580547c3923167a5f382094e2dad503e561665d7825517c35669cf86ea0d93f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also E by multiplying D has made A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,E乘以D, 已经做了A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"06e561aecec5ef6e28018d7f16eaed0ce956fb63cd816d1da73e2f637e20cfe8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the product of E, D is equal to the product of H, M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E,D的产值等于H,M的产值。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94a43df8f428467e1c23ab4acb3ec3dc9b4e73a017f22dcc3d6798c14669f908","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as E is to H, so is M to D. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E比H等于M比D；E 与 H 之比等于 M 与 D 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f7fd49bcdaa2f66f16dd6b6bb421f1dbc12dd4144863b065726750515391926","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But E is greater than H; therefore M is also greater than D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但E超过H,因此M也超过D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d9d05bae1d5a536e65c1198bcbfeead0bedb1d55675b5cca0c84de13cc4e8348","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it measures A, B, C: which is impossible, for by hypothesis D is the greatest common measure of A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,A,B,C,这是不可能的,因为假设D是A,B,C中最大公约数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab1a87f9d9832656d59251bc9a80a4222472039162035a1c4363bfea723433dd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore there cannot be any numbers less than E, F, G which are in the same ratio with A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,不能有低于E、F、G的男女比例相同,分别为A、B、C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":21,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c06e2276d2907b7a5cc31fe301d0989455a36cf10b739198066d51bc6fb05d53","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore E, F, G are the least of those which have the same ratio with A, B, C. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E,F,G是A,B,C中比例相同的最低者。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-33.source","contentId":"euclid-7-33","revisionId":"euclid-7-33@raw-2cc356a98027fcd3","order":22,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"24504871300da96d466ba6b740261ff03073fd65f17c96761eba8bb8f7be3592","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https: